    <briefdescription>
<para>Decorator that adds a label to any element with alignment. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps an element and adds a text label either to the left (single line) or above (multi-line).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Element type to label </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TAlign</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Alignment strategy for label (<ref refid="structevab_1_1_left_align" kindref="compound">LeftAlign</ref>, <ref refid="structevab_1_1_center_align" kindref="compound">CenterAlign</ref>, <ref refid="structevab_1_1_right_align" kindref="compound">RightAlign</ref>) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>TText</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Text type (const char*, __FlashStringHelper*) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
